[b]A brand new build of Endless Melody's Demo![/b]

Includes many bug fixes and enhancements over the last public build.

•added small perspective look to sprites in battle;
•added a Chrono-Talk feature where NPC's can be walked away from once engaged;
•added a pause function across the entire game;
•added hidden treasures & enemies;
•added an accessibility highlight around interactable objects;
•many other things added or fixed;

First run will prompt you to delete existing save files as any file created before November 23 2023 will no longer be compatible, and will crash the game on trying to save/ load.

That's pretty much it I think for now! Happy gaming gamers!
